# Evidence briefs

- Path: `pathways/{disease}/{setting}/evidence.md`
- Purpose: 60-second pre-visit skim, not a full guideline dump
- Required sections: Bottom line, Who this applies to, Standard options, Landmark evidence, Biomarkers, Toxicity anchors, Watch list, Sources to re-check, Changelog
- Never invent trial statistics; verify or leave qualitative
- On every edit: set Last reviewed (YYYY-MM-DD) and append Changelog
- Sister EpiAI project stays at `/Users/Alex/Documents/EpiAI`
